  "transcript": "Canonical serialisation: JSON with all keys recursively sorted in lexicographic order, no whitespace, no trailing newlines. The proposal artifact is serialised to proposal_canon.json; a third party computes hProposal = sha256(proposal_canon.json) and verifies it matches d9dc7a234b213ce4fdf5295fcd2bb6f9af2326bfd51e167d149bde5e0a496b5e. The seed is derived as seedHex = sha256(hProposal || salt) where salt = 31e7e465ded92d5f88c30e83746c7be3b4c474a1fe52ed1daa09a38a3c1dce73 and || denotes concatenation of hex strings; this yields f713367ae22061231356e739243e17bfae30771e4a5d3b2a54db341931855a98. The draw rule is deterministic census: all 95 witnesses from census.json in their listed order, without replacement, no randomness."
